    (3, "Wilfried Zaha, Palace's most-capped Premier League player, left in 2023 for which club?", ["Galatasaray", "Arsenal", "Marseille", "Fenerbahçe"], 0, "Galatasaray in Turkey, after two spells and over 450 games for Palace."),
