    (3, "The fan group behind the drums and flags at Selhurst Park is called what?", ["The Holmesdale Fanatics", "The Eagles Ultras", "The Selhurst Boys", "The Glaziers"], 0, "The Holmesdale Fanatics, named after the stand they fill. The best atmosphere in London, by some accounts."),
