    (2, "Everton's new stadium, opened in 2025, is built where?", ["Bramley-Moore Dock", "Stanley Park", "Kirkby", "Aintree"], 0, "Bramley-Moore Dock, on the Mersey waterfront north of the city centre."),
    (3, "Where did Everton play before moving to Goodison Park in 1892?", ["Anfield", "Stanley Park", "Priory Road", "Walton Breck"], 0, "Anfield. A row over rent saw Everton leave, and the landlord started a new club there: Liverpool."),
    (2, "Tim Cahill, famous for punching the corner flag when he scored, is from which country?", ["Australia", "New Zealand", "Ireland", "South Africa"], 0, "Australia. He scored 56 Everton goals and boxed a lot of corner flags."),
    (3, "In which position did Everton finish in 2005, earning a Champions League qualifying place?", ["Second", "Third", "Fourth", "Sixth"], 2, "Fourth, above Liverpool, who then won the Champions League that same season. Everton fans do not enjoy that detail."),
    (3, "The Gwladys Street End was the home fans' stand at which ground?", ["Goodison Park", "Anfield", "Villa Park", "Elland Road"], 0, "Goodison Park. The team always tried to attack towards it in the second half."),
